name: sim.floatingViewRemove
description: Removes a floating view previously added with sim.floatingViewAdd.
luaSynopsis: int result = sim.floatingViewRemove(int floatingViewHandle)
pythonSynopsis: int result = sim.floatingViewRemove(int floatingViewHandle)
inputs:
1. floatingViewHandle: handle of the floating view to be removed
outputs:
1. result: 0 if the floating view could not be found (e.g. because closed by the user), or 1 if the floating view was closed.
